  "Routing snapshot of the GPU scene classifier per golden cell on the parity fixture (default preset, dpr 2, k 1/2/4/8 plus the coastline switch frames), taken at gpu/w1-glue after the camera fixes and re-taken at gpu/w2-text (straight non-label text as native glyphs; military also picks up the empty-image skip). A cell fails when native/compat/skipped drift, so a routing change (new native primitive, a layer sliding to compat) must update this file in the same commit.",
  "Regenerate: node bench/gate/gate.ts golden fixture=parity k=1,2,4,8 coastk=1.4,1.6,2.5,2.7, then keep the census.json of that run without the kinds field.",
  "Lake k 2/4/8 cells use the k*-lake cameras added after this snapshot; their counts are identical to the k 1 cell."
